(The Lantern model removes the recurrent connection altogether. Each position) Tj
T*
(attends over every other position through a learned similarity function, so) Tj
T*
(the path length between any two positions is constant rather than linear in) Tj
T*
(their distance. Constant path length is what makes long-range dependencies) Tj
T*
(learnable in practice.) Tj
T*
