(2.1 Gated retrieval A retrieval function maps a query and a set of key-value) Tj
T*
(pairs to an output. The output is a weighted sum of the values, where the) Tj
T*
(weight assigned to each value is computed by a compatibility function of the) Tj
T*
(query with the corresponding key. We scale the dot products by the inverse) Tj
T*
(square root of the key dimension, which keeps gradients well-conditioned as) Tj
T*
(dimension grows.) Tj
T*
() Tj
T*
